// ............................................................................ 
// Quests
// ............................................................................ 

Q_GREETPRIMOGEN_S               Greet the Primogen in the Barclay Lobby.
Q_GREETPRIMOGEN_L               After visiting your haven, return to the Barclay South Lobby to meet Bill and discuss the arrival of the Primogen.
Q_RETURNTOHAVEN_S               Return to your haven.
Q_RETURNTOHAVEN_L               Return to your hotel suite haven in the Barclay South to rest.
Q_FINDDOMINIC_S                 Find Dominic.
Q_FINDDOMINIC_L                 Locate Dominic's Slum Room in New York's Downtown.
Q_BLOODPACT_S                   Find Blood Pact.
Q_BLOODPACT_L                   Locate and retrieve the Blood Pact from the bowels of the warehouse.
Q_INVADEWAREHOUSE_S             Invade Dominic's Warehouse.
Q_INVADEWAREHOUSE_L             Invade Dominic's Warehouse in New York's Downtown.
Q_SEWERPASSAGE_S                Enter the Barclay Lobby from the Sewers.
Q_SEWERPASSAGE_L                Use the Sewers to find the secret entrance to the Barclay Lobby.


